  "job_B8.4.3.3_20251003_114855": {
    "chunk_text": ". \u00d0a \u00fea gafolgyldan gegaderude w\u00e6ron \u00fea s\u00e6de he \u00feam forman, hu mycel scealt \u00feu minum hlaforde? \u00d0a s\u00e6de he, hund sestra eles. \u00dea s\u00e6de he him, nim \u00feine fe\u00f0ere & site hra\u00f0e & writ fiftig. \u00d0a s\u00e6de he o\u00f0rum, hu mycel scealt \u00feu; \u00fea cw\u00e6\u00fe he, hund mittena hw\u00e6tes; \u00f0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 he, nim \u00feine \u00d0a herede se hlaford \u00fe\u00e6re unrihtwisnesse tungerefan, for\u00feam \u00fee he gleawlice dyde, for\u00feam \u00f0e \u00f0isse & ic secge eow, wyrca\u00f0 eow frynd of \u00feisse woruldewelan unrihtwisnesse \u00fe\u00e6t hig onfon eow on ece Se \u00fee ys on lytlum getrywe, se ys on maran getrywe & se \u00fee ys on lytlum unrihtwis se ys eac on Gif ge on unrihtwisum weoruldwelan n\u00e6ron getrywe hwa bet\u00e6h\u00f0 eow \u00fe\u00e6t eower ys. And gyf ge on fremedum n\u00e6ron getrywe hwa syl\u00fe eow \u00fe\u00e6t eower ys. Ne m\u00e6g nan \u00feeow twam hlafordum \u00feeowian, o\u00f0\u00f0e he anne hata\u00f0 & o\u00f0erne lufa\u00f0, o\u00f0\u00f0e he anum \u00d0as \u00f0ing ealle \u00fea Farisei gehyrdon \u00fea \u00f0e gifre w\u00e6ron, & hig hine t\u00e6ldon. \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 he to him, ge synt \u00fee eow sylfe beforan mannum gerihtwisia\u00fe; So\u00f0lice God can eowre Seo \u00e6 & witegan o\u00f0 Iohannem, & of him is bodud Godes rice, & ealle on \u00fe\u00e6t strangnysse wyrca",
